From da51fdcd9cf09be44cc518fda73ff53b712fec96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 09:56:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ffmpeg for arm64: the Media Kit gets something to decode with

The image had the codec libraries -- mpg123, lame, flac, vorbis, opus --
and no way to reach them: /boot/system/add-ons/media/plugins held
http_streamer and raw_decoder, and nothing else. Haiku decodes MP3, AAC
and video through its ffmpeg plugin, which build/jam/BuildFeatures
builds only when ffmpeg6_devel is available, and for arm64 it never was.
The build said so on every run ("package ffmpeg6 not available!") and
MediaPlayer could open nothing.

ffmpeg 6.1.6 is now built by prosepkg (our overlay recipe: no SDL2, no
subtitle stack, every codec, NEON assembly in -- 931 neon symbols in
libavcodec), and listed here with the libraries it wants: fdk_aac,
game_music_emu, gmp, libopenmpt, soxr. The plugin follows from the build
feature; ffmpeg6_tools brings ffmpeg and ffprobe with it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Prose-Patch: 0080-ffmpeg-for-arm64-the-media-kit-gets-something-to-decode-with.patch 4e0ba8fa8b3bbd63224aef2852f5a74c1743cde02c866ebf265ad7608af50dda
---
 build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles          |  6 ++++++
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 | 14 ++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
index 3ebdb69470..d27141b234 100644
--- a/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
+++ b/build/jam/DefaultBuildProfiles
@@ -230,6 +230,12 @@ rule DefineDefaultBuildProfiles
 				jetbrains_mono
 				firacode
 				openssl3
+				# ffmpeg's own programs. The library and its plugin come in
+				# anyway, as the ffmpeg build feature (build/jam/BuildFeatures)
+				# is what builds the Media Kit's decoder; these two are the
+				# command line, and avdevice is what they link against.
+				ffmpeg6_avdevice
+				ffmpeg6_tools
 				pe
 				vision
 				xz_utils
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index 323328e353..816d9454f5 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
